  "body": "The reviews of PR #1330 found these items. PR #1330 is merged (bd0400ebb). Source comments: 6976973927 and 6977814135.\n\nItems:\n\n- Centre cache: `State::move_center` and `CenterCache` in `crates/ui/src/move_drag.rs` keep the facet `Arc` of the last part that showed handles.\n  - After that part is deleted, or Move mode is off, the mesh stays in memory.\n  - The cache holds one entry, so the cost is bounded.\n  - Clear the cache when `handles` finds no draggable part.\n  - Add a test that pins this.\n- File lengths: `crates/ui/src/egui_app/viewport_bar.rs` has 461 lines. `crates/ui/src/egui_app/shell.rs` has 1080 lines.\n  - Split each file along its domain seam.\n  - The `#[test]` count stays the same.\n- Move glyph: the Move glyph looks almost the same as the Pan glyph.\n  - Draw a glyph that a user can tell apart.\n  - Use Tabler Icons, or an original glyph (AGENTS.md \"Assets\").\n- CRLF line ends: `crates/ui/src/egui_app/shell.rs` has CRLF line ends on `main`. The other files of the crate have LF.\n  - Convert the file in a commit of its own.\n  - Do this when few open PRs change this file.\n- Formatting check: `cargo fmt -p camcraft-ui --check` reports about 4500 differences across the crate.\n  - Decide if the crate is formatted in one commit, or if the check stays unused.\n  - Record the decision in `docs/decisions/`.\n\nDone means: each item is done, or has a recorded decision.\n",
